<div class="mandarin-hanzi">饭店</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">fàndiàn</div>

''Meaning:'' restaurant; hotel (regional/contextual senses)  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
这家饭店的菜很好吃。 — Zhè jiā fàndiàn de cài hěn hǎochī. — The food at this restaurant is delicious.

!! Usage note
May mean 'restaurant' or 'hotel', depending on region, establishment and context. The example illustrates the restaurant sense; do not infer that every 饭店 sign identifies a restaurant.
